w to actually score points.} 26 {Do you ever wonder what it feels like to win? Yeah, me neither.} 27 {Zzzzzz... Oh sorry, I fell asleep watching this thrilling tie game.} 28 {Tie games: the ultimate cure for insomnia.} 29 {Breaking news: the tie game epidemic continues to sweep the nation... or not.} other{}}}",
